WEBVTT

01:03:00.000 --> 01:03:01.559
in the work context?

01:03:01.583 --> 01:03:02.976
AG: Hypothetically.

01:03:03.000 --> 01:03:05.851
Woman 3: Hypothetically,
what is a good reason to stay?

01:03:05.875 --> 01:03:08.809
And what if, even if you stay,

01:03:08.833 --> 01:03:14.768
what is a way to think
about something more

01:03:14.792 --> 01:03:16.518
in a relationship to work

01:03:16.542 --> 01:03:18.518
that is productive and meaningful

01:03:18.542 --> 01:03:23.476
and healthy without jumping around
in a disorganized way?

01:03:23.500 --> 01:03:26.184
AG: I mean, I --
You're not going to be surprised,

01:03:26.208 --> 01:03:27.583
there's a framework on this.

01:03:28.542 --> 01:03:31.809
So Hirschman wrote
about exit, voice and loyalty,